  "_about": "Privacy prefilter rules (APR-0113; ADR-0003, contracts/policy/privacy.yaml). The CEO can read and edit the lists. Words are matched as whole words, any case, a trailing s or es is allowed. Any doubt means high: a turn is low only if it matches a low topic and nothing else. The text is matched in memory and never stored or logged. This file is the only place the lists live: the Python prefilter and the gating plugin both read it (the plugin keeps a byte-identical copy, checked by a test).",
